{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Chess Coach 是一款國際象棋學習 App，專為初學者與中級玩家而設；它以 Stockfish 引擎分析每一步棋，並提供即時評分、免費提示與結構化課程，讓玩家在對弈中理解每步棋背後的思路。原價 US $29.99，現在限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>即時評分與免費提示</h2>\n<p>Chess Coach 以 Stockfish 引擎即時評分每一步棋，標示妙手、好棋、不精確、錯誤或漏著；難以抉擇時可免費查看最佳步法與淺白解釋，無每日限制。內置課程涵蓋戰術、殘局與開局思路，並提供 Puzzle Rush、開局訓練與棋盤掃描；引擎評分、提示、謎題和課程也可離線使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-517-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-518-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-519-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-520-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-521-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-522-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Chess Coach: Play &amp; Learn</li>\n<li>應用類別：Games</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-08T01:29:21.186890+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":328,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}